---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { products } from '../site';

const p = products.game;
---

<Base
  title={`${p.name} · ${p.label}`}
  description="Astral Game：建房、短码或邀请链接进房，游戏联机客户端。"
  currentPath="/game/"
>
  <section class="product-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="section-kicker amber">{p.label}</p>
        <picture>
          <source srcset={p.logoDark} media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
          <img class="product-logo" src={p.logo} alt={`${p.name} logo`} width="300" height="72" data-logo-light={p.logo} data-logo-dark={p.logoDark} />
        </picture>
        <p class="section-lead">Astral 游戏客户端。建房、分享短码或邀请链接，进房开黑。</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-amber" data-open-game-download>{p.downloadLabel}</button>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/download/#game">全部下载</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="shell">
      <ul class="feature-list amber reveal">
        <li><strong>三栏主界面</strong> 联机 / 服务器 / 设置。</li>
        <li><strong>房间</strong> 创建或加入；9 位短码，或 next.astral.fan/j / astralgame:// 邀请链接。</li>
        <li><strong>房间里</strong> 成员、延迟、流量累计、开放游戏。</li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong> 局域网发现与组播 / 本机转发；Linux、Android 进房即可。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note reveal">
        需要多实例或自己改 TOML？请用 <a href={products.general.path}>通用版</a>。游戏版没有配置编辑器。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
